# Modes and owners on the root image that differ from the build tree, read
# by mkfs -p (tools/mkfs/mkfs.c, docs/design/users.md). One entry per line,
# "path mode uid gid", mode octal or "-" to keep the bits of the build
# tree. A path ending in "/" includes everything below it. Everything not
# named here belongs to root.
/tmp 1777 0 0
/etc/shadow 0600 0 0
